{du'o ro remna naku} then. But is that right?
{du'o ro remna lo skalduna bangu naku ckini lo drata bangu} - "Everyone knows 
that Basque isn't related to another language."
{du'o ro remna lo skalduna bangu na ckini lo drata bangu} - "Basque isn't 
known by everyone to be related to another language."
{du'o lo remna lo skalduna bangu na ckini lo drata bangu} - "Basque isn't 
known by man to be related to another language."
The last one sounds the closest to what I mean.

